    "created_at": "2024-10-03T19:54:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-03T19:54:33Z",
    "body": "FYI, we ended up reverting this in https://github.com/WebAssembly/memory64/pull/86 because the special [conversion rules](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#js-bigint) for a union of numeric type and bigint would, through [ToNumeric](https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-tonumeric)/[ToNumber](https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-tonumber), force all string and boolean values to be interpreted as Number instead of BigInt. This is a very confusing special case.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
